
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Feedback | Knowledge Hub Library</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7fb;
            color: #263238;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #123b5d;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #082b45;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffc857;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #164e75, #287e9e);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 45px 20px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .intro, .feedback-form, .contact {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #00000012;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #123b5d;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        input, select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-top: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #ccd5df;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        textarea {
            resize: vertical;
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            background: #123b5d;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px;
            margin-top: 22px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #287e9e;
        }

        .contact {
            border-left: 5px solid #287e9e;
        }

        footer {
            background: #082b45;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #ffc857;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 12px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>📚 KNOWLEDGE HUB LIBRARY</h1>
    <p>Read, Learn and Grow</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="membership.html">Membership</a>
    <a href="book-request.html">Book Request</a>
    <a href="feedback.html">Feedback</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>We Value Your Feedback</h2>
    <p>Your ideas help us improve our library services.</p>
</section>

<main class="container">

    <section class="intro">
        <h2>💬 Share Your Experience</h2>

        <p>
            Knowledge Hub Library is committed to providing
            quality educational resources and services.
            We welcome feedback from students, teachers,
            researchers and community members.
        </p>

        <p>
            Use the form below to share your experience,
            report challenges or suggest improvements.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="feedback-form">

        <h2>Feedback Form</h2>

        <form action="#" method="post">

            <label for="name">Full Name (Optional)</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name"
                placeholder="Enter your name">

            <label for="email">Email Address (Optional)</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email"
                placeholder="Enter your email">

            <label for="type">Feedback Category</label>
            <select id="type" name="type" required>
                <option value="">Choose feedback category</option>
                <option>General Comment</option>
                <option>Suggestion</option>
                <option>Complaint</option>
                <option>Book or Resource Recommendation</option>
                <option>Website Improvement</option>
                <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <label for="rating">Rate Your Experience</label>
            <select id="rating" name="rating" required>
                <option value="">Select your rating</option>
                <option>Excellent</option>
                <option>Very Good</option>
                <option>Good</option>
                <option>Fair</option>
                <option>Poor</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Your Feedback</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message"
                rows="6"
                placeholder="Write your comments or suggestions here..."
                required></textarea>

            <button type="submit">
                Submit Feedback
            </button>

        </form>

    </section>

    <section class="contact">
        <h2>📞 Get in Touch</h2>

        <p>
            Have additional questions or need assistance?
            You can use our feedback form to communicate
            with the Knowledge Hub Library team.
        </p>

        <p>We appreciate your participation and support.</p>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Knowledge Hub Library. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    <p>Read • Learn • Research • Grow</p>
    <p><a href="index.html">Return to Home</a></p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
